 "etapas": [
  {
   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "To want",
     "texto": [
      "**Хотеть** has an irregular conjugation: хочу, хочешь, хочет, хотим, хотите, хотят.",
      "**Что вы хотите?** = what do you want? (formal) **Я хочу кофе** = I want coffee."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Three ways to order",
     "texto": [
      "**Дайте, пожалуйста, борщ** = please give me borscht.",
      "**Я буду блины** = «I'll have blinis». In a restaurant, **я буду + dish** is a common formula for ordering; here it is not translated word for word as «I will be blinis».",
      "**Мне чай, пожалуйста** = a tea for me, please."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "With and without",
     "texto": [
      "**С** («with») usually takes the **instrumental** case: with many masculine and neuter nouns, **-ом/-ем** appears (**с молоком**, with milk), and with many feminine nouns, **-ой/-ей** (**с водой**, with water).",
      "**Без** («without») takes the **genitive**: **без сахара**, without sugar; **без воды**, without water. The endings change depending on the noun; there is not one single ending for all."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "What you will hear",
     "texto": [
      "**Вот меню** = here is the menu. **Что ещё?** = anything else? **Это всё** = that's all. **Вот, пожалуйста** = here you are.",
      "**Приятного аппетита!** = enjoy your meal!",
      "To pay: **Счёт, пожалуйста** = the bill, please."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
